<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States signed a military cooperation agreement with Venezuela's interim government, and a U.S. marine died after falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed ties. Former oil minister Machado called for a more drastic overhaul of the oil sector amid hyperinflation, food shortages, massive emigration and socioeconomic collapse. Venezuelan grassroots groups rejected the agreement and denounced what they called a normalization of subordination, while military prisoners entered a third week without food and families took the fight to court. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBkZ0diMS03M0p4bXVmSE9WVTRKRmtIUmxjS3hKandnMnEyWkd2MTdxbDRFbXZlT0Z1NW5OWm5ueHlCM0ZGdHh2cDM2c1JVNmozaE1aUWNNMGpOZk1z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1CNGFESWlsQ3lnMGZfdVlNSXRfT1ByS1FzYUo0ZXpZT09hMDJMSGVVbXF3VGZlOFlTVDFBa1ZLaU1KUW1wbUFPQ3loUVpfQ2xhRmY0M3ZtZkhHX3hnVXNHTWx5M3VvZWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1BOHRNVDdIbzg4eXJMbkxGMi1QSTRHSGtKWDlSckJsS1NUV3pvbjNhQ0NwbDE0Y21pRUkwTDRPdFZFckMxMm56Tmprdy15UEY2ZzFvcDFNanN1bTNvUTVpNzR6X1BMMkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFA4UWJCbDZsTEh3OS1mM3RieVNhQ1FQY282M2M3MnNnRW9qSk9WYzl0SHRNMFZ0X0lQcExKZkpKcnlIOEtNMW9hNFdKR05OWmU4d051ekNubXRIbXRpUXZ5SmlleG5SOVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5zVnJGdDhzdVRVeW5nSVhhZmdXcUpLa00tSzlXd3NVejVIUGhXYi1VZVc2aXlpT0NrM3d6RExpd3FaTVRRbldNNlNmcGNCSTVFVkJqeWZrMVhYTkVubktHNDFyZzNVUzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt